  "title": "1-Bit Memory Cell",
  "description": "Build a circuit that remembers a single bit using two cross-coupled NAND gates. Inputs are active-low: pulse S low to set, R low to reset, and hold both high to remember whatever it last saw.",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "tags": ["sequential", "memory"],
  "gateBudget": 2,
